(7445402, 1176750, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is fascinating to look at. Very un-photographic in nature. Strong abstract qualities. It draws my eye without answering anything for my mind. I have a small, nagging, worry that this is a photo of an existing artwork. I hope you made some Notes for my curious mind.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM.<br/> <br/>[eta]<br/>Thanks for the Notes. I could not think of how anyone would get a chance to photograph so large a crowd :D or how the art deco feeling got in there :D or where the person in the hoodie came from. To me it looked like a 1920''s ballroom, except of course for the smiley face balloons. And the light is excellent. I see now the freeway details, but not before. Anyway, it just proves (again) that the best camera is the one in your hand. Good eye.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-03-22 08:42:26.</i></td>', 'This is fascinating to look at. Very un-photographic in nature. Strong abstract qualities. It draws my eye without answering anything for my mind. I have a small, nagging, worry that this is a photo of an existing artwork. I hope you made some Notes for my curious mind.  Please accept this Flying Pig HM. [eta]Thanks for the Notes. I could not think of how anyone would get a chance to photograph so large a crowd :D or how the art deco feeling got in there :D or where the person in the hoodie came from. To me it looked like a 1920''s ballroom, except of course for the smiley face balloons. And the light is excellent. I see now the freeway details, but not before. Anyway, it just proves (again) that the best camera is the one in your hand. Good eye.', '2016-03-21 23:54:30.000000', '2016-03-22 08:42:26.000000', 1),
