(7445408, 1177104, 63218, '<td valign="top">O look at all the energy in this and I''m delighted to see the veils &amp; trails of water.  Fire and water. Dark and light. Someone is dancing like no-one can see her.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM.</td>', 'O look at all the energy in this and I''m delighted to see the veils & trails of water.  Fire and water. Dark and light. Someone is dancing like no-one can see her.  Please accept this Flying Pig HM.', '2016-03-21 23:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445409, 1177207, 63218, '<td valign="top">Effective graphic, it''s like they are dancing with their shadows, or forming endless moving glyphs, secret messages. And that blood-red color is a perfect choice to set them off.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM.</td>', 'Effective graphic, it''s like they are dancing with their shadows, or forming endless moving glyphs, secret messages. And that blood-red color is a perfect choice to set them off.  Please accept this Flying Pig HM.', '2016-03-21 23:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445411, 1177556, 63218, '<td valign="top">this looks fresh &amp; new &amp; incredibly ancient a the same time. An Ancient Egyptian Cow.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM.</td>', 'this looks fresh & new & incredibly ancient a the same time. An Ancient Egyptian Cow.  Please accept this Flying Pig HM.', '2016-03-21 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445412, 1177558, 63218, '<td valign="top">There are many interesting comps in this challenge. This one is a standout for its air of exploration &amp; discovery.  The story it tells is an abstract one. The artist discovers new facets of her Self thru the adventures of self-expression. Please accept this Flying Pig Best in Show for this Expert FS.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>[eta]<br/>When the model stops hiding her face from the camera &amp; instead faces it boldly, it becomes quite photogenic. So, I learned from this comp that it''s not the face itself that''s photogenic, it''s the attitude.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-03-22 10:18:21.</i></td>', 'There are many interesting comps in this challenge. This one is a standout for its air of exploration & discovery.  The story it tells is an abstract one. The artist discovers new facets of her Self thru the adventures of self-expression. Please accept this Flying Pig Best in Show for this Expert FS.   [eta]When the model stops hiding her face from the camera & instead faces it boldly, it becomes quite photogenic. So, I learned from this comp that it''s not the face itself that''s photogenic, it''s the attitude.', '2016-03-21 23:56:37.000000', '2016-03-22 10:18:21.000000', 1),
