(7445425, 1177368, 19944, '<td valign="top">Congrats!<br/> <br/>My mom (who had 13 of us), had #2 and #3 exactly (to the day) one year apart.  #10 &amp; #11 were 10 months/24 days apart.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats! My mom (who had 13 of us), had #2 and #3 exactly (to the day) one year apart.  #10 & #11 were 10 months/24 days apart. ', '2016-03-22 08:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445426, 1177368, 131871, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> hehe Samantha''s got her mommy face on!  Are you down to only one cat now?  Hope not...:-/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nope! Our orange kitty is doing well, she just would have added an extra element to this already very busy shot, so I opted to keep her out of it. Which she was happy to do because she does not like the baby. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: hehe Samantha''s got her mommy face on!  Are you down to only one cat now?  Hope not...:-/   Nope! Our orange kitty is doing well, she just would have added an extra element to this already very busy shot, so I opted to keep her out of it. Which she was happy to do because she does not like the baby. :)', '2016-03-22 08:53:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445427, 1177368, 131871, '<td valign="top">thank you everyone!! We are scared and excited all over again. Just when I thought I was getting a hang of this mom thing.....a new one is on the way to add a whole new dimension to this parenting gig. :)</td>', 'thank you everyone!! We are scared and excited all over again. Just when I thought I was getting a hang of this mom thing.....a new one is on the way to add a whole new dimension to this parenting gig. :)', '2016-03-22 08:54:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445429, 1177368, 60581, '<td valign="top">This is so cute! Congratulations!</td>', 'This is so cute! Congratulations!', '2016-03-22 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445431, 1177368, 121362, '<td valign="top">Congrats :)  Great photo but yes it made more sense after I saw the first one.  And this made me smile because I also got short time between my kids, but still far from topping your 13 months :)<br/></td>', 'Congrats :)  Great photo but yes it made more sense after I saw the first one.  And this made me smile because I also got short time between my kids, but still far from topping your 13 months :)', '2016-03-22 12:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445432, 1177104, 114969, '<td valign="top">What an explosion. I love the energetic composition, we see way too many photos of static poses, some action is great! The tinting is also quite creative, nothing seen very often neither. Long live creativity! Congrats on the ribbon as well.</td>', 'What an explosion. I love the energetic composition, we see way too many photos of static poses, some action is great! The tinting is also quite creative, nothing seen very often neither. Long live creativity! Congrats on the ribbon as well.', '2016-03-22 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445433, 1176650, 114969, '<td valign="top">I hope I can witness such scenery myself one of these days. Iceland is clearly a photographer paradise, even if the conditions are rough I imagine. In any case thanks for sharing your experience with us, it sure is appreciated very much. Oh, and congrats on the well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'I hope I can witness such scenery myself one of these days. Iceland is clearly a photographer paradise, even if the conditions are rough I imagine. In any case thanks for sharing your experience with us, it sure is appreciated very much. Oh, and congrats on the well deserved ribbon!', '2016-03-22 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 0);
